一次攻击也算。单纯提高攻击力、攻速，以及吸血、暴击、分裂弹射归各自词条", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "ab2ccd3b5feb10543915", "mechanism": "break_sensitive", "mechanism_zh": "可被破坏", "definition": "技能（或技能的一部分）会被破坏暂时失效；以游戏文件IsBreakable=1为准", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "271348090c4ee27b4ef3", "mechanism": "cleave", "mechanism_zh": "分裂溅射", "definition": "攻击伤害波及周围单位", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "e4568f4833c66bfd7363", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "kunkka_x_marks_the_spot", "name_zh": "昆卡·X标记", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Targets a friendly or enemy Hero, marks their position with an X, and returns them to it after several seconds. Kunkka can trigger the return at any time during the duration. Lasts twice as long on allied heroes.", "facets_loc": ["When X Marks the Spot returns its target, Kunkka and allies near the return spot gain Ghostship's Admiral's Rum buff."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Targets a friendly or enemy Hero, marks their position with an X, and returns them to it after several seconds. Kunkka can trigger the return at any time during the duration. Lasts twice as long on allied heroes.", "facets_loc": ["When X Marks the Spot returns its target, Kunkka and allies near the return spot gain Ghostship's Admiral's Rum buff."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cast_ranges", "old": [550, 700, 850, 1000], "new": [675, 750, 875, 1000]}, {"field": "AbilityCastRange", "old": {"base": [550, 700, 850, 1000], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [675, 750, 875, 1000], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:kunkka_x_marks_the_spot:displace_other:base", "mechanism": "displace_other", "mechanism_zh": "位移他人", "definition": "拉、推、交换、投掷其他单位（如动人之舐、移形换位）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "67b79feb784f7551b69a", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "largo_amphibian_rhapsody", "name_zh": "朗戈·两栖狂想曲", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Largo gets ready to groove. He is disarmed and his ability bar switches to 3 song abilities, each with different effects. Songs are only effective if strummed on the beat. Every time he strums successfully, he gains a stack of Groovin'. Each stack gives him bonus armor and reduces the mana cost of every song, but he loses a stack if he misses a beat. Stacks linger for a short duration when Largo's song ends.", "notes_loc": ["Items can be used while in this mode."], "scepter_loc": "Largo can play two songs per beat by strumming both at the same time."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Largo gets ready to groove. He is disarmed and his ability bar switches to 3 song abilities, each with different effects. Songs are only effective if strummed on the beat. Every time he strums successfully, he gains a stack of Groovin'. Each stack gives him bonus armor and reduces the mana cost of every song, but he loses a stack if he misses a beat. Stacks linger for a short duration when Largo's song ends.", "notes_loc": ["Items can be used while in this mode."], "scepter_loc": "Largo can play two songs per beat by strumming both at the same time."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cooldowns", "old": [2], "new": [1.5]}, {"field": "AbilityCooldown", "old": {"base": [2], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [1.5], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "fbc550f5018e7f7e0acf", "mechanism": "disarm", "mechanism_zh": "缴械", "definition": "目标无法普通攻击", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "largo_catchy_lick", "name_zh": "朗戈·动人之舐", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Largo licks the targeted unit with his tongue, pulling it back a short distance, applying a basic dispel, and dealing damage if it's an enemy. Killing or dispelling an effect from a target grants Largo temporary health regeneration. DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_loc": ["Can lick runes to pull them."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Largo licks the targeted unit with his tongue, pulling it back a short distance, applying a basic dispel, and dealing damage if it's an enemy. Killing or dispelling an effect from a target grants Largo temporary health regeneration. DISPEL TYPE: Basic Dispel", "notes_loc": ["Can lick runes to pull them."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "cooldowns", "old": [13, 11, 9, 7], "new": [15, 12, 9, 6]}, {"field": "AbilityCooldown", "old": {"base": [13, 11, 9, 7], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [15, 12, 9, 6], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}, {"field": "dispel_hp_regen", "old": {"base": [4, 7, 10, 13], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [2.5, 5, 7.5, 10], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "08c3bc240a87ae90cf48", "mechanism": "aoe_damage", "mechanism_zh": "范围伤害", "definition": "一次施放或一次攻击能对多个敌方单位造成伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "c3272a16ec9f44e1ca14", "mechanism": "applies_basic_dispel", "mechanism_zh": "施加弱驱散", "definition": "移除目标身上可被弱驱散的效果", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "0432e0b6ce377ba601e8", "mechanism": "displace_other", "mechanism_zh": "位移他人", "definition": "拉、推、交换、投掷其他单位（如动人之舐、移形换位）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "7dc61ffd245ed6757635", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}, {"review_id": "3a1a51d1bf3316e326b3", "mechanism": "unit_target_spell", "mechanism_zh": "单体指向技能", "definition": "主动技能或物品施放时，可以选择敌方单位为目标；允许同一技能或物品也能选择友方。指向方式不推断是否触发林肯格挡或莲花反弹，具体交互分别核对。", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "largo_croak_of_genius", "name_zh": "朗戈·灵呱一闪", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Largo strums a tune to a friendly hero. The hero's items and abilities have reduced mana cost and a percentage of their damage reverberates over the following %damage_duration% seconds. When an affected hero spends mana, the remaining buff duration is reduced by %duration_reduction%s. Duration is not reduced for Largo himself.", "notes_loc": ["Only applies to damage sources affected by spell amplification.", "Only applies to damage where the source and target are within %max_distance% units of each other."]}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Largo strums a tune to a friendly hero. The hero's items and abilities have reduced mana cost and a percentage of their damage reverberates over the following %damage_duration% seconds. When an affected hero spends mana, the remaining buff duration is reduced by %duration_reduction%s. Duration is not reduced for Largo himself.", "notes_loc": ["Only applies to damage sources affected by spell amplification.", "Only applies to damage where the source and target are within %max_distance% units of each other."]}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "damage_portion_pct", "old": {"base": [30, 35, 40, 45], "scepter": null, "shard": null}, "new": {"base": [25, 30, 35, 40], "scepter": null, "shard": null}}], "rows": [{"review_id": "bc723361c7b823e3101e", "mechanism": "spell_amp", "mechanism_zh": "法术放大", "definition": "提高技能造成的伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}]}, {"subject": "largo_song_double_time", "name_zh": "朗戈·疾步生风", "category": "4_行为/目标/驱散/免疫/A杖魔晶", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Largo plays a song that increases nearby friendly units' movement speed and grants a brief slow resistance."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Largo plays a song that increases nearby friendly units' movement speed and grants a brief slow resistance."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "behavior", "old": "9007207844677701", "new": "8589936709"}], "rows": [{"review_id": "56d75a717e78ea1ae320"