6da3127472d", "mechanism": "magic_resist_reduction", "mechanism_zh": "减魔抗/魔法易伤", "definition": "降低目标魔抗，或让目标受到更多魔法或技能伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "reject"}, {"review_id": "1308b5cfb5842f9552b2", "mechanism": "spell_amp", "mechanism_zh": "法术放大", "definition": "提高技能造成的伤害", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "largo_song_good_vibrations", "name_zh": "朗戈·大屿灵药", "category": "4_行为/目标/驱散/免疫/A杖魔晶", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Largo plays a song that heals nearby friendly heroes."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Largo plays a song that heals nearby friendly heroes."}, "changed_fields": [{"field": "behavior", "old": "9007207844677701", "new": "8589936709"}], "rows": [{"review_id": "8de52a1022429003bbd3", "mechanism": "healing", "mechanism_zh": "治疗/回复", "definition": "恢复生命值（治疗、生命恢复），含属性生命恢复（如治疗指环+4.5）", "condition": "base", "decision": "accept"}]}, {"subject": "legion_commander_duel", "name_zh": "军团指挥官·决斗", "category": "2_纯数值", "text_741f": {"desc_loc": "Legion Commander and the target enemy hero are forced to attack each other for a short duration. Neither hero can use items, and the target enemy hero cannot use abilities. If either hero dies during the duration, the hero winning the Duel gains permanent bonus damage.", "notes_loc": ["Duels will end if the units are pushed 2000 units apart."], "scepter_loc": "When Legion Commander wins a duel, Press the Attack is automatically triggered around her."}, "text_742": {"desc_loc": "Legion Commander and the target enemy hero are forced to attack each other for a short duration. Neither hero can use items, and the target enemy hero cannot use abilities. If either hero dies during the duration, the hero winning the Duel gains permanent bonus damage.", "notes_loc": ["Duels will end if the units are pushed 2000 units apart."], "scepter_loc": "When Legion Commander wins a duel, Press the Attack is automatically triggered around her."}, "changed_fields": [], "rows": [{"review_id": "audit:legion_commander_duel:app